Added custom defined variables to prompts for form input values

```
variables = {
    "username": {
        "name": "username",
        "description": "The username which should be input",
        "value": "Test123"
    }
}

# Initialize controller
controller = Controller(variables=variables)

```

`test.py --task="go to http://localhost:3000 and input the @username"`
